飯的精髓就在那顆半熟蛋，一定要把蛋汁戳破、狠狠拌進肉跟飯裡一口塞，那個美味程度真的會讓人忍不住在心裡「哇」出來；這時候再配上一口口感細膩滑順、醬汁濃郁的胡麻豆腐，比一般裹粉的炸豆腐更讓人驚艷，直接列入我私心的必點清單。\n\n整體用餐氛圍很溫馨，從客製化細節到店員的貼心，都讓人覺得這是一家有溫度的店。想吃精緻又滿足的一餐，這間絕對值得回訪！",null,[0,122]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10769450912268087798/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR6ZEZwVVduUmpSa2t3VGtoUk1XTnFXalpOTTFaQ1ZERndhVTFXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,319,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tzdFpUWnRjRkkwTkhRMWNqWjZNM1ZCVDFwaU1WRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb4e18b907c4b348c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkstZTZtcFI0NHQ1cjZ6M3VBT1piMVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tzdFpUWnRjRkkwTkhRMWNqWjZNM1ZCVDFwaU1WRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tzdFpUWnRjRkkwTkhRMWNqWjZNM1ZCVDFwaU1WRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tzdFpUWnRjRkkwTkhRMWNqWjZNM1ZCVDFwaU1WRRILMGVJX2M3dHdHUzAaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rc3RaVFp0Y0ZJME5IUTFjalo2TTNW